<title>UK: TorDom leads C$250 mln 12-year zero coupon bond. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>TorDom leads C$250 mln 12-year zero coupon bond. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects maturity from 29.MAY.09, issue price from 46.78, reoffer price from 45.53)</p>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CANADA ZERO 2009</p>
<p> AMT	  C$250 MLN COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    02.JUN.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  46.75     PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    45.50     SPREAD	+52 BP</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/CA/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ONTARIO   LISTING    LONDON    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	BACKED BY CANADIAN GOVERNMENT BONDS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
